# Amazon MQ Amazon MQ Migration Guide

> Describes migrating from commercial, on-premises message brokers to Amazon MQ for ActiveMQ.

- [What is the Amazon MQ migration guide?](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/concept-chapter-about.md)
- [Migration approaches](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/migration-approaches.md)
- [Migrating without service interruption](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/interruption-scenarios.md)
- [Migrating to Amazon MQ for RabbitMQ](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/rabbitmq-migration-guide.md)
- [Amazon MQ for ActiveMQ Throughput benchmarks](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/chapter-benchmarks.md)
- [Supported plugins](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/amazon-mq-supported-plugins.md)
- [Document history](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/amazon-mq-mig-guide-release-notes.md)

## [Migrating from IBM MQ](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/concept-chapter-ibm-amazon.md)

- [IBM MQ architecture for migration](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/ibm-mq-typical-architecture.md): This section shows typical IBM MQ broker topoloogies for high availability use cases.
- [Replicating IBM MQ architecture with Amazon MQ](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/amazon-mq-architecture.md): Learn how you can replicate a common IBM MQ architecture pattern with Amazon MQ.
- [Re-platforming IBM MQ to Amazon MQ](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/ibm-re-platform.md): Learn how to re-platform your existing IBM MQ messaging brokers to Amazon MQ.
- [Validating your migration to Amazon MQ](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/testing-and-validation.md): Learn how to test and validate the availbability of your brokers.


## [Migrating from TIBCO EMS](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/concept-chapter-tibco-amazon.md)

- [TIBCO EMS architecture for migration](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/tibco-ems-typical-architecture.md): This section shows typical TIBCO EMS broker topoloogies for high availability and cross-regional use cases.
- [Replicating TIBCO EMS architecture with Amazon MQ](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/tibco-amazon-mq-architecture.md): Learn how you can replicate a common TIBCO EMS broker architecture pattern with Amazon MQ.
- [Re-platforming TIBCO EMS to Amazon MQ](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/tibco-re-platform.md): Learn how to re-platform your existing TIBCO EMS messaging brokers to Amazon MQ.
- [Validating your migration to Amazon MQ](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazon-mq/latest/migration-guide/tibco-testing-and-validation.md): Learn how to test and validate the availbability of your brokers.


